# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
#
# lib/ is deliberately TRACKED, not ignored: `dsh plugin add file:<repo>` and
# `dsh plugin add github:<owner>/<repo>` both install the root package without
# running any lifecycle script (pnpm runs none for `file:` directory deps and
# blocks git-hosted builds behind allowBuilds), so the shipped artifacts have
# to already exist in the checkout. Rebuild with `pnpm build` after every
# source change and commit the result — test/lib-fresh.test.ts fails when
# lib/ no longer matches src/.
legacy/agent/.gotmp/

